|passage=The parish stank of idolatry, abominable rites were practiced in secret, and in all the bounds there was no one had a more evil '''name''' for the black traffic than one Alison Sempill, who bode at the Skerburnfoot.}}
#* '''1952''', ''{{w|Old Testament}}, Revised Standard Version'', Thomas Nelson & Sons, [http://etext.virginia.edu/etcbin/toccer-new2?id=Rsv2Sam.sgm&images=images/modeng&data=/texts/english/modeng/parsed&tag=public&part=8&division=div1 2 Samuel 8:13]:
